OL,3,GNEWSAThe 'frustrating' education limbo
OL,4,Afacing teenage asylum seekers
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn war-torn Gaza, 16-year-old Mona was
OL,7,Fable to receive more education than she
OL,8,Fsays she is currently able to get in
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,11,FThat is because, as a refugee or asylum
OL,12,Fseeker aged 16, she is not
OL,13,Fautomatically able to enter school or
OL,14,Fcollege in Northern Ireland.
OL,16,FAt present, the legal age until which
OL,17,Feducation is compulsory is 16.
OL,19,FBut that can leave young people like
OL,20,FMona, who have fled conflict to come to
OL,21,FNorthern Ireland, with no automatic
OL,22,Fright to education.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
